{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793897673194, "sessionID": "ses_e535e4625ffe531dgZIffgIy52", "part": {"id": "prt_1aca226e50014EVXVrOEzns1td", "messageID": "msg_1aca2210a001T952oWqk42ts8y", "sessionID": "ses_e535e4625ffe531dgZIffgIy52", "type": "text", "text": "**Three services depend directly on `UserService`:**\n- `ApiGateway`\n- `AuditService`\n- `OrderService`\n\nEach has an explicit `DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService` relationship. `ApiGateway` also calls `UsersAPI`.\n\n**The available architecture data does not establish how long a revoked session token can still be accepted.** It contains no session-token cache duration, revocation propagation delay, or token-expiry setting, so a time limit cannot be determined from these tools.\n\nFor completeness, `UserService` stores data in `UsersPostgresDatabase` and is configured by `ORDER_DB_URL` for its read replica. That configuration does not specify token-revocation timing.", "time": {"start": 1793897670373, "end": 1793897673189}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_06952190ce95ce3c016aecb4c6540887d19613b2a28da3038e", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
